  @@unique([targetKind, targetId, targetKey], map: "UQ_CircuitBreakerConfigs_target")
  @@map("CircuitBreakerConfigs")
}

/// Durable ledger of every transition, including manual trips and resets. **Append-only**
/// by grant, never deleted (§1.4). Drained from Redis into SQL by `shj3-worker`, because
/// the AI runtime cannot write outside its three groups (§3.6).
///
/// `CK_CircuitBreakerEvents_manualHasActor CHECK (reason NOT IN
/// ('ManualTrip','ManualReset') OR actorStaffUserId IS NOT NULL)` — a manual trip is
